00:16:58,290 --> 00:17:00,440
我们初次见面时  你我是敌人
When we first met, we were enemies,

358
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:03,930
但我们解决了矛盾  成为了朋友
but we worked through that and we became friends.

359
00:17:03,930 --> 00:17:06,110
你真想回到当初吗
Do you really want to go back?

360
00:17:06,110 --> 00:17:09,890
老实说  感觉没什么不同
Honestly, it doesn't feel very different.

361
00:17:12,670 --> 00:17:14,120
我不会走的
I'm not leaving!

362
00:17:14,120 --> 00:17:17,140
好吧  那我就放狗出来咬你
All right, I'm gonna sic my dog on you.

363
00:17:17,530 --> 00:17:19,230
你又没有养狗
You don't have a dog.

364
00:17:19,230 --> 00:17:20,830
有的
Yes, I do.

365
00:17:21,580 --> 00:17:22,830
我分辨不出你是否在说谎
Ugh, I can't tell if you're lying--

366
00:17:22,830 --> 00:17:24,930
你演技太高超了
you're such a good actor!

367
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:30,270
你好吗
Hey, how you doing?

368
00:17:30,270 --> 00:17:32,080
你怎么来了
What are you doing here?

369
00:17:32,080 --> 00:17:34,340
我就顺路过来看看
Oh, I just came by, you know,

370
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:36,930
看你是否需要帮忙
to see if you need any help.

371
00:17:36,930 --> 00:17:38,830
霍华德和伯纳黛特派你来监督我
Howard and Bernadette asked you to check up on me.

372
00:17:38,830 --> 00:17:41,120
这话不全对
That is not entirely true.

373
00:17:41,120 --> 00:17:44,810
还有莱纳德和  所有人
So did Leonard and... everybody.

374
00:17:44,810 --> 00:17:47,170
你们是觉得我有多不负责任啊
How irresponsible do you all think I am?

375
00:17:47,170 --> 00:17:49,370
我们不觉得你不负责任啊
We don't think you're irresponsible.

376
00:17:49,370 --> 00:17:50,950
我们只是觉得你...
We think you're...

377
00:17:51,370 --> 00:17:53,360
喜爱玩耍
fun-loving.

378
00:17:53,770 --> 00:17:56,590
这只是"不负责任"好听一点的说法
That is just a nice word for "Irresponsible."

379
00:17:57,120 --> 00:18:00,300
看来你比我们想的要机智
You might be more on the ball than we thought.

380
00:18:02,850 --> 00:18:04,460
我有点饿了
I'm getting a little hungry.

381
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:05,820
这次我来吧
Want me to get it this time?

382
00:18:05,820 --> 00:18:07,440
那再好不过了
That'd be great.

383
00:18:11,420 --> 00:18:12,710
真好玩
This is fun.

384
00:18:12,710 --> 00:18:16,880
你也能看到一个气鼓鼓的金发妞走进来
And now you also get to see an annoyed blonde walk into the room.

385
00:18:17,810 --> 00:18:19,030
干嘛
What?

386
00:18:20,290 --> 00:18:21,750
能给我们拿点零食吗
Can you get us a little snack?

387
00:18:21,750 --> 00:18:24,530
不叫你们的间谍去拿吗
You sure you don't want your spy to do it?

388
00:18:24,530 --> 00:18:25,640
你在说什么呢
What are you talking about?

389
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:28,530
你们真的很不信任我  还让艾米过来看看
You really don't trust me? You had to have Amy stop by?

390
00:18:28,530 --> 00:18:30,360
-我们信任你  -是啊
- We trust you. - Yeah.

391
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:31,780
你是个糟糕的服务员
You were a terrible waitress,

392
00:18:31,780 --> 00:18:34,460
我们还是叫你给我们拿零食了啊
and we still asked you to get us a snack.

393
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:39,720
失陪一下  我要去照顾你们的宝宝
Excuse me while I go take care of your baby.

394
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:40,830
然后我会拿零食给你们
Then I'll bring you your snack,

395
00:18:40,830 --> 00:18:43,970
到时你们就可以继续羞辱我了
and you can insult me some more.

396
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:45,370
不知道你怎么想
I don't know about you,

397
00:18:45,370 --> 00:18:48,440
但我绝对不会吃她送来的食物
but I am not eating whatever she brings us.

398
00:18:50,370 --> 00:18:52,050
哈雷  没事的
Hey, Halley. Aw, it's okay.

399
00:18:52,050 --> 00:18:55,920
佩妮阿姨来了  我帮你换尿布
Auntie Penny's here. Shh. Let's get you changed.

400
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:57,640
你爸妈说他们相信我
Your mommy and daddy say they trust me,

401
00:18:57,640 --> 00:19:01,180
但他们满嘴都是你尿布里现在包着的东西
but they're full of the same stuff your diaper is.

402
00:19:02,390 --> 00:19:03,900
这下我内疚了
Now I feel bad.

403
00:19:03,900 --> 00:19:05,930
反正她从没喜欢过我
Well, she never really liked me.

404
00:19:05,930 --> 00:19:08,800
现在她也讨厌你  感觉还不赖
It's kind of nice she hates you now, too.

405
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,340
但你有我呢
Aw, but I'm here for you,

406
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:12,200
我不会让你受到任何伤害
and I would never let anything happen to you,

407
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:15,610
因为佩妮阿姨真的好爱好爱你
because your Auntie Penny loves you so much.

408
00:19:15,610 --> 00:19:17,400
妈妈
Mama.

409
00:19:24,570 --> 00:19:25,820
那是她第一个词吗
Was that her first word?

410
00:19:25,820 --> 00:19:27,730
妈妈
Mama.

411
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:31,640
不不  宝宝  我不是你妈妈
Uh, no. No, baby. I'm not your mama.

412
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:34,200
你妈妈是我们现在要去见的那位善良女士
Your mama's the nice lady we're gonna go see right now

413
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:36,850
这样我就能在她面前嘚瑟啦
so I can rub this in her face.

414
00:19:37,990 --> 00:19:39,260
听见了吗  你俩贱人
Do you hear that, suckers?

415
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:42,160
她叫我妈妈
She called me Mama!

416
00:19:56,910 --> 00:19:58,890
你好  亚瑟
Hello, Arthur.

417
00:19:58,890 --> 00:20:00,350
你知道
You-you know,

418
00:20:01,470 --> 00:20:06,070
我们  我们也可以在熟食店见面的
we could... we could also meet in-in a deli.

419
00:20:08,620 --> 00:20:10,890
很抱歉告诉你  我辜负了你
I'm sorry to say that I failed you.

420
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:13,580
我试过阻止威尔·惠顿出演质子教授
I tried to stop Wil Wheaton being Professor Proton,

421
00:20:13,580 --> 00:20:15,660
但我没能做到
but I couldn't.

422
00:20:15,660 --> 00:20:18,490
知道吗  这种事情
See, now, that's-that's the kind of thing

423
00:20:18,490 --> 00:20:21,430
很适合边吃熏牛肉三明治
you could tell a fella over a...

424
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:25,140
边告诉对方的
pastrami sandwich.

425
00:20:29,090 --> 00:20:30,610
别担心
Well, don't worry.

426
00:20:30,610 --> 00:20:33,160
现在他会永远在我的仇家名单里
He's now on my enemies list forever.

427
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:35,280
我跟他永世绝交
He's totally cut off.

428
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:36,640
有意思
Interesting.

429
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:41,540
其他人能去哪登记上那份名单呢
Can-can anyone sign-sign up for that list?

